  abilityName: Cerberus Invocation
  abilityDesc: 11 combo powerful Fire attack on all foes, powerful Fire attack on
    single foe (damage relative to remaining HP), casts stealth on self boosting
    own Atk and critical hit rate for 2 turns, considerably boosts own Spark damage
    for 3 turns, adds probable evasion to self for 1 turn & slightly boosts OD gauge
